Value Required PROTOCOL (.+?)
Value ROUTER_ID (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value DISTANCE (\d+)
Value MAX_PATHS (\d+)

Start
  ^Routing\s+Protocol\s+is\s+"${PROTOCOL}"\s*$$ -> Protocol
  ^.*$$

Protocol
  ^Routing\s+Protocol\s+is\s+ -> Continue.Record
  ^Routing\s+Protocol\s+is\s+"${PROTOCOL}"\s*$$
  ^\s*Router\s+ID(?:\s+is)?\s+${ROUTER_ID}\s*$$
  ^\s*Maximum\s+path:\s*${MAX_PATHS}\s*$$
  ^\s*Distance:\s+\(default\s+is\s+${DISTANCE}\)\s*$$
  ^.*$$
